    "short_description": "Embark on an enchanting journey with &quot;Lampy,&quot; a mesmerizing puzzle-platformer that promises universal appeal. Navigate captivating levels, overcome obstacles, and immerse yourself in a world of wonder. Guide Lampy through intricately designed challenges and discover the magic around every corner.",
